GhostUnlock-XQ-GE74
Copyright 2026 rgnv

This repository contains a port of GhostLock (CVE-2026-43499) for the
Sony Xperia 1 VIII (XQ-GE74).

This product includes software developed as part of the following projects,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- GhostLock / ghostlock-app — https://github.com/YuKongA/ghostlock-app
  (exploit engine, offset extractor; the prebuilt binaries in prebuilt/ are
  compiled from that source with device offsets for the Xperia 1 VIII)
- CyberMeowfia — https://github.com/NebuSec/CyberMeowfia
  (upstream GhostLock research and exploit source)

Kernel offsets in offsets/ were derived from an independently obtained
firmware image; offsets and constants are not copyrightable facts, but they
are published here under the same Apache-2.0 terms for convenience.

This repository intentionally contains no firmware, no KernelSU-licensed
code (KernelSU is late-loaded at runtime from the user's own manager APK),
and no device-unique data.

